PRD only promises "діагностика парсера ([DBG] ...)" with no defined format. Treated as an informational,
undocumented internal diagnostic (likely the parser's minimum expected token count for this command's
dispatch entry), not a deviation from any PRD requirement. Not filed as a bug; noted in bugs/Improvements.md
for completeness.

